{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"The fine weather is now past, but the pleasant days in Aranjuez are not quite over, for I shall spend a few more here; there is still much that I do not know. But to consider this, and what I already know, more exhaustively, a few weeks would certainly not have been enough. — This morning the Kleins are leaving from here; although it was hardly possible for us to go about and see things together much, we did see each other at table, and it was a very pleasant company."}}],"created":1795080387,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":108,"prompt_tokens":185,"total_tokens":293,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-C0DLVYYMKlprP85iFVOUqHjgAeKXsycn","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":185,"prompt_ms":379.611,"prompt_per_token_ms":2.0519513513513514,"prompt_per_second":487.34098853826686,"predicted_n":108,"predicted_ms":2552.508,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.855214953271027,"predicted_per_second":41.91955519825991}}